        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value",
              "& when (@gradientBg)": {
                "background": "linear-gradient(45deg, @bg-value, @color2)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "h1": {
              "margin-bottom": "0.2rem"
            },
            ".container-fluid": {
              "padding": "0"
            },
            "img": {
              "height": "100%",
              "object-fit": "cover",
              "position": "relative",
              "z-index": "10"
            },
            ".mbr-figure": {
              "height": "100%"
            },
            ".col-lg-6": {
              "padding": "0"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#747474"
            },
            "hr": {
              "width": "40px",
              "height": "2px",
              "top": "-1rem"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "margin-bottom": "3.5rem"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle-1": {
              "color": "#836202"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle-2": {
              "margin-top": "4.2rem",
              "color": "#cc2952"
            },
            ".mbr-figure::after": {
              "content": "\"\"",
              "background-color": "@dangerColor",
              "height": "100px",
              "width": "100px",
              "position": "absolute",
              "bottom": "-20px",
              "right": "-5px",
              "z-index": "1"
            },
            "@media (min-width: 767px)": {
              ".row": {
                "margin": "0"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".media-content": {
                "padding-left": "2.2rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
              ".left-block": {
                "margin-top": "4.5rem"
              }
            },
            ".btn": {
              "color": "#101010 !important"
            },
            ".btn:hover": {
              "color": "#ffffff !important"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".media-content, .mbr-section-title, .line-title": {
              "color": "#030612"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"header3 vertical-line\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle 2\" name=\"showSubTitle2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Line\" name=\"showLine\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bg2-trouphy.jpg\" selected parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f3f3f3\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Gradient\" name=\"gradientBg\" condition=\"bg.type == 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#f5c40d\" condition=\"gradientBg && bg.type == 'color'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#fcf6c7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-5\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-figure\">\n                    <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/trouphy-page-new-2.png\" alt=\"Taiwo Oduala\" title=\"Afro Awards - Taiwo Oduala\"></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-7 left-block\">\n                <div class=\"media-content\">\n                  <div class=\"line line-title\" mbr-if=\"showLine\" data-app-selector=\".media-content, .line\"></div>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title  align-left mbr-bold mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".media-content, .mbr-section-title, .line-title\"><p>The date is here! <br>AFRO AWARDS 2024&nbsp;<br>in Los Angeles. CA, U.S.A</p><p>@ The prestigious :\n</p><p>DGA- DIRECTORS GUILD OF AMERICA\n</p><p>VENUE:<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> 7920 Sunset Blvd, Los Angeles, CA 90046, USA.</span></p></h2>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-section-subtitle-1 mbr-bold align-left mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle-1\">CREDIBLE AND VERSATILITY APPLICATION DESIGNER. BUILDS AWARDS PLATFORM.</h3>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-text\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Hollywood Movie Director, Taiwo Oduala, CEO <b>Oduataj Productions and Entertainment Inc.</b><br><br>The third edition of the Afro Awards is set to be held in&nbsp;<b>2024</b>&nbsp;in<b> Los Angeles, California</b>, <b>United States</b>.&nbsp;<br><br>Speaking on the development, Oduala, who is the Chief Executive Officer of <b>Oduataj Productions and Entertainment Inc, </b>group umbrella that powers the event with support from other entities,&nbsp;the <b>AFRO AWARDS&nbsp;</b> project is borne out of the need to reward humanitarian and excellence in the global society, involvement in .<br><br>The Organisers explained further that the project seeks to reward <b>individuals</b> and <b>organizations</b> for their extra ordinary hard work and consistency towards the uplifting others in the global society and all over the continent.&nbsp;<br><br>Part of this information was during the maiden edition in 2022. Now we are informing you to get ready for the 2024 edition of the <b>Afro Awards 3.0</b>&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-section-subtitle-2 mbr-bold align-left mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle-2\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/cyrilrobinson/\" target=\"_blank\">FAKON EMPIRE ENTERTAINMENT AWARDS COMMENCES 2022 WITH FREE ENTRY TICKET FOR IBANLA FILM PREMIERE IS NOW OVER. THANK YOU FOR THOSE WHO WAS ABLE TO ATTEND AND IT WAS A HISTORY MADE. A VERY BIG THANK YOU TO ALL. GOD BLESS!&nbsp;</a></h3>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a class=\"btn mbr-bold text-black btn-danger\" href=\"page3.html#content1-w\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Continue</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "studiom4",
