        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "line-height": "1.55",
              "color": "#191f23"
            },
            ".price": {
              "margin-top": "5px",
              "color": "#d90a2c"
            },
            ".symbol": {
              "line-height": "1.1",
              "top": "3px",
              "vertical-align": "top",
              "position": "relative",
              "color": "#ff2121"
            },
            ".mbr-section-btn": {
              "margin": "10px 0 0 0"
            },
            ".btn-md": {
              "padding": "0 20px 0 15px ",
              "height": "50px",
              "margin": "0 !important",
              "&:hover": {
                "background-color": "@secondaryColor !important",
                "border-color": "@secondaryColor !important"
              },
              ".mbr-iconfont": {
                "margin": "5px 0 0 !important",
                "animation-name": "none",
                "order": "0"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-iconfont:after": {
              "content": "\"\"",
              "display": "inline-block",
              "vertical-align": "middle",
              "height": "23px",
              "width": "1px",
              "background-color": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)",
              "margin": "0 10px 0 10px"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".content__block, .price__block": {
                "margin-bottom": "30px"
              }
            },
            ".descr": {
              "color": "#444345"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#404e98"
            },
            ".descr, .price__block, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#010612"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"content1\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Price\" name=\"showPrice\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/conference28_1920.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f5f7fd\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#149dcc\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-sm-12 content__block\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-12 mb-3' : !showPrice, 'col-lg-6' : showPrice}\">\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">What About Afro Awards 2024?</h2>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">The Afro Awards is an annual event that celebrates excellence and achievement within the African community. It typically honors individuals and organizations who have made significant contributions to various fields, including but not limited to business, arts and culture, science and technology, social impact, and community development.\n<br>\n<br>The awards aim to recognize and showcase the diverse talents, accomplishments, and positive impact of Africans and people of African descent worldwide. They provide a platform for highlighting success stories, inspiring others, and fostering pride and unity within the African diaspora.\n<br>\n<br>The Afro Awards ceremony often includes presentations, performances, and speeches by notable figures and awardees, as well as networking opportunities for attendees. It serves as a prestigious event where outstanding individuals and organizations are celebrated for their achievements and contributions to their communities and society at large.\n<br>\n<br>Overall, the Afro Awards play a significant role in promoting excellence, empowerment, and positive representation within the African community while also fostering connections and collaboration on a global scale.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6 price__block\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\">\n                <div class=\"price__block\">\n                    <span mbr-text class=\"price mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".price\">Version</span>\n                    <span mbr-text class=\"symbol mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".symbol\">3.0</span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"descr mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".descr, .price__block, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Afro Awards</b><br><br><i><b>An outline of the plan for 2024 Ver. 3.0 arrangement:</b></i><br><br><b>Establish Organizing Committee: <br></b>An organizing committee comprising individuals with expertise in event planning, marketing, public relations, and relevant fields would be formed to oversee the planning and execution of the Afro Awards ceremony.\n<br><br><b>Define Objectives and Theme:</b> The committee would define the objectives of the awards ceremony, such as recognizing excellence within the African community, promoting positive representation, and fostering unity. A theme for the awards ceremony might also be chosen to guide the planning process and provide a cohesive narrative for the event.\n<br><i><br></i><br></p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-danger\" href=\"#\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"li_note mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 60px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span>&nbsp;INVITATION IS OPEN</a></div>\n                </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_cid": "t8QKptOMp6",
          "_anchor": "content1-n",
          "_sourceTheme": "conferencem4",
