          "_name": "content1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"header3 vertical-line\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle 2\" name=\"showSubTitle2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Line\" name=\"showLine\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bg2-trouphy.jpg\" selected parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f3f3f3\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Gradient\" name=\"gradientBg\" condition=\"bg.type == 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#f5c40d\" condition=\"gradientBg && bg.type == 'color'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#fcf6c7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-5\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-figure\">\n                    <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/trouphy-page-new-2.png\" alt=\"Taiwo Oduala\" title=\"Afro Awards - Taiwo Oduala\"></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-7 left-block\">\n                <div class=\"media-content\">\n                  <div class=\"line line-title\" mbr-if=\"showLine\" data-app-selector=\".media-content, .line\"></div>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title  align-left mbr-bold mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".media-content, .mbr-section-title, .line-title\">AFRO AWARDS 2024</h2>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-section-subtitle-1 mbr-bold align-left mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle-1\">CREDIBLE AND VERSATILITY APPLICATION DESIGNER. BUILDS AWARDS PLATFORM.</h3>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-text\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\"The event is also directed at encouraging hard work among individuals and organizations the apex might seem out of reach, albeit, with the necessary effort, you will get there.<br>&nbsp;<br>\"<b>AFRO AWARDS 2024</b>&nbsp;will bring together big names in global event industries across the globe, and it would be the best avenue to get to meet, network with personalities, and possibly have interactions that would change the course of many creative and industrialist lives.<br><br>\"Mr Taiwo Oduala hopes to bring the world together and make it a better place. The fans are already anticipating this big event, your support is also very essential,\" a statement by the organizers indicated.&nbsp;<br><br>Born in 1976 the brain behind the project, Oduala, is an award-winning movie director with 30 years of experience in the entertainment industry, and 25 years experience as a film director. He is the president of <b><i>Oduataj Foundation</i></b> And <b><i>Oduataj Entertainment Music</i></b> Label, He is a full member of the <b>Directors Guild of Nigeria (DGN)</b>.<br>&nbsp;<br>He began his career in Entertainment and film making in 1991 as a stage/television director until 1994 when he started full time training as a Film and Screen director. Between 1994-1997, he earned the necessary qualification and experience that made him a full-time Film director. He is a graduate of Sociology from Lagos State University and an alumnus of Colorado film school USA where studied film making.<br><br><b>NOMINATION ONGOING FOR AWARDEES..!!!</b><br>\n<br><br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-section-subtitle-2 mbr-bold align-left mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle-2\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/cyrilrobinson/\" target=\"_blank\">FAKON EMPIRE ENTERTAINMENT AWARDS COMMENCES 2022 WITH FREE ENTRY TICKET FOR IBANLA FILM PREMIERE IS NOW OVER. THANK YOU FOR THOSE WHO WAS ABLE TO ATTEND AND IT WAS A HISTORY MADE. A VERY BIG THANK YOU TO ALL. GOD BLESS!&nbsp;</a></h3>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><a class=\"btn mbr-bold text-black btn-danger-outline\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/cyrilrobinson/\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">More on LINKEDIN</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_isUserblock": true,
