        {
          "alias": "mobirise4-blocks/components",
          "_isSecondary": true,
          "typeCompatible": "type",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".card": {
              "padding": "1rem 1rem 3rem 1rem"
            },
            ".card-img": {
              "padding-bottom": "2rem",
              "border-radius": ".25rem",
              "img": {
                "border-radius": ".25rem",
                "-webkit-box-shadow": "0px 0px 30px fade(spin(desaturate(@infoColor, 75%), 12%), 30%)",
                "box-shadow": "0px 0px 30px fade(spin(desaturate(@infoColor, 75%), 12%), 30%)"
              }
            },
            ".section-text,.card-text": {
              "color": "#8d97ad"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".section-text,.card-text, .card-title,.mbr-section-title": {
                "text-align": "center"
              }
            },
            ".section-text": {
              "color": "#465052"
            },
            ".card-text,.mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            "H2": {
              "color": "#d90a2c"
            }
          },
          "_name": "extFeatures28",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"extFeatures\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"> \n        \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Section Buttons\" name=\"showSectionButtons\" checked>\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Сards Title\" name=\"showContentTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse Content\" name=\"reverseContent\" condition=\"cardsAmount !== '1'\" checked>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background4-3.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://youtu.be/iM-NestDPNQ\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#efefef\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay&&bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6':cardsAmount<3,\n                             'col-md-4':cardsAmount>2,\n                             'order-md-2': reverseContent&amp;&amp;cardsAmount>1}\">\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Sponsorship Packages unveiling soon.</h2>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-text section-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".section-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\"><a href=\"https://punchng.com/movie-director-oduala-to-launch-maiden-afro-awards-in-los-angeles/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>https://punchng.com/movie-director-oduala-to-launch-maiden-afro-awards-in-los-angeles/</b></a></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\"></span></div><div><br></div><div>“AFRO AWARDS 2023 is one that will bring together big names in the global industries across the globe, and it would be the best place to get to meet with other personalities, and possibly have interactions that would change the course of lives.&nbsp;\n</div><div>\n</div><div><b><a href=\"https://www.sunnewsonline.com/taiwo-oduala-set-to-launch-afro-awards-2022/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.sunnewsonline.com/taiwo-oduala-set-to-launch-afro-awards-2022/</a></b> &nbsp;\n<br><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\">Taiwo Oduala set to launch AFRO AWARDS 2023.<br><br><b>Sponsorship Packages unveiling soon.</b></span></div><div>\n</div><div><br></div></h3>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSectionButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-md mx-3 btn-danger\" href=\"pressrelease.html#extFeatures28-17\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Read More</a></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6':cardsAmount<3,\n                             'col-md-4':cardsAmount>2}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-img\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/congratulations-los-angele.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                    <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>Sponsorship is very open to who soever want to support the event now or after.&nbsp;</b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text card-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text,.mbr-section-btn\"><a href=\"https://punchng.com/movie-director-oduala-to-launch-maiden-afro-awards-in-los-angeles/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>https://punchng.com/movie-director-oduala-to-launch-maiden-afro-awards-in-los-angeles/</b></a><br><br><b>Taiwo Oduala set to launch AFRO AWARDS 2023</b><br><b>Please take note, Afro Awards is an Annual event to celebrate people with exceptional characters and business and humanitarian minset, helping in their quest to change the world to be better. The world need to celebrate you on an excellent stage - <br>the Afro Awards forever!<br></b><br><b> Sponsorship Packages unveiling soon.</b><br>&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn-underline mr-3\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">&nbsp; Read More</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6':cardsAmount<3,\n                             'col-md-4':cardsAmount>2}\">\n                <div class=\"card-img\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/company-name.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                    <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>ODUATAJ ENTERTAINMENT INC. U.S.A</b><br><br><b>Foremost Movie Director, Taiwo Oduala, CEO Oduataj productions and Entertainment Inc. is set to lead the unveiling of the AFRO AWARDS 2023 in Los Angeles. Maiden edition on the Sunday, 16th of September, 2023.</b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text card-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text,.mbr-section-btn\">2nd Annual AFRO AWARDS 2023.<br>Saturday Sept 16th, 2023.<br>*****<br>PRE- AFRO AWARDS EVENT<br>Friday Sept 15th, 2023.<br><br> \n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn-underline mr-3\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Read More</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
