        "meta_descr": "AFRO AWARDS NOMINEES\nWelcome to the Afro Awards were we have created to Recognize and Celebrate outstanding excellent individuals who dedicate their color difference to Supporting humanity anywhere their accomplishments touch life.\n\n#AfroAwards2023",
