          },
          "_name": "content1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"content1\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Price\" name=\"showPrice\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/conference28_1920.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f5f7fd\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#149dcc\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-sm-12 content__block\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-12 mb-3' : !showPrice, 'col-lg-6' : showPrice}\">\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">Get a VVIP invitation, Support or Sponsor&nbsp;<br>Afro Awards...</h2>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Afro Awards is established with the highest honor and the most prestigious platform for recognizing individuals and organizations <br>who have demonstrated exceptional generosity<br><br><b>Note:</b> Critical normination is currently ongoing globally for the <br>most prestigious Afro Awards in Los Angeles, (This is the Sure <br>Award for 2022)<br><br>It is global, all worldwide nominees, foundation owners, charity builders, music fund raisers, superstars in the film business, <br>business philanthropy.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6 price__block\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\">\n                <div class=\"price__block\">\n                    <span mbr-text class=\"price mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" data-app-selector=\".price\">15</span>\n                    <span mbr-text class=\"symbol mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".symbol\">nominee</span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"descr mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".descr, .price__block, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>* Still Counting and partnership are upgrading, contributors working earnestly day and night.</b><br><br><b>Afro Awards this </b><br><b>is the highpoint </b><br><b>to partake in this maiden Awards in </b><br><b>Los Angeles.&nbsp;</b></p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-sm-6\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-md btn-danger\" href=\"#\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mbrib-sites mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\" style=\"font-size: 40px; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></span>BUY TICKET $500</a></div>\n                </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
