          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"clients\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"BootstrapCarouselSwipe,mbr-clients-slider\" data-interval=\"false\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Items\" name=\"slidesCount\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"17\">\n        <select title=\"Visible Slides\" name=\"visibleSlides\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\" selected>6</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"showAutoplay\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Autoplay Interval (ms)\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1000\" max=\"8000\" step=\"1000\" value=\"2000\" condition=\"showAutoplay\">\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Gradient Background\" name=\"gradientBg\" checked condition=\"bg.type=='color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#0b1233\" condition=\"gradientBg &&bg.type=='color'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>  \n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n        <div class=\"container mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle||showSubtitle\">\n            <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 align-center\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">:: <b>AWARD SUPPORTERS AND PARTICIPANTS ADVERTS AT THE HUMANITARIAN AND EXCELLENCE AWARDS - AFRO AWARDS 2.0</b>&nbsp;::&nbsp;</h2>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\"><i>...for a minimum rate, your business Brand Logo will gain public link back to your official website on click on your brand identity. It is&nbsp;</i><br><i>designed to promote and advertise your brand and services.&nbsp;</i><i>Make use of our <b>#LogoAdvertSpace </b>advantage. We love your visit and </i><br><i>would appreciate your patronage and sponsorship engagement to touch and encourage those who cares about humanity and </i><br><i>the very needy of global existence, from America to the rest of the continents of Africa, we have synegestically come together to realise </i><br><i>the power in celebrating an effort of great people keeping the world safe. Those who supports making the world a better habitat, <br>Touching lives in so many ways we have not noticed shall be unveiled &nbsp;- a celebration of &nbsp;<b>\"Humanitarian and Excellence\"</b>.</i></h3>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"carousel slide\" role=\"listbox\" data-pause=\"true\" data-keyboard=\"false\" data-ride=\"{{showAutoplay ? 'carousel' : 'false'}}\" data-interval=\"{{showAutoplay ? interval : 'false'}}\">\n            <div class=\"carousel-inner\" mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"slidesCount\" data-visible=\"{{visibleSlides}}\">\n                <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://hadifafrica.org\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/hadif.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"HADIF\" title=\"HADIF FOUNDATION\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://afroftema.org\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/afroftema.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"AFROFTEMA AWARDS\" title=\"AFROFTEMA AWARDS\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://cyrilrobinson.com\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-16.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"CYRILROBINSON.COM WEB MEDIA\" title=\"WEB MEDIA & CREATIVE COMPANY\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://tututechllc.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/512-x-512.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"#TUTUTECHLLC\" title=\"#TUTUTECHLLC\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n            <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"https://flowrhythm.studio/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/flowrythm.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"FLOW RHYTHM - It's a Win - Win situation\" title=\"FLOW RHYTHM - It's a Win - Win situation\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://www.oduatajfoundation.com\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/oduataj-foundation.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"http://www.oduatajfoundation.com\" title=\"ODUATAJ FOUNDATION\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-5.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"Advertisement\" title=\"Advertisement\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-6.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"Advertisement\" title=\"Advertisement\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-7.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"EEF\" title=\"EEF\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-8.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"EEF\" title=\"EEF\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"https://tututechllc.com\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/512-x-512.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"#TUTUTECHLLC\" title=\"#TUTUTECHLLC\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/osun-state-logo.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"EEF\" title=\"EEF\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-5.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"Advertisement\" title=\"Advertisement\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"nanorn.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-29.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"CYRIL ROBINSON'S NANORN HUB LIMITED\" title=\"CYRIL ROBINSON'S NANORN HUB LIMITED\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/zafaa.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"ZAFAA GLOBAL AWARDS\" title=\"ZAFAA GLOBAL AWARDS\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"https://www.dga.org\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/dga.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"directors guild of america - DGA\" title=\"directors guild of america - DGA\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-12.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"ADVERT SPACE - OPEN AD SPACE. CALL NOW\" title=\"ADVERT SPACE - OPEN AD SPACE. CALL NOW\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div></div>\n            <div class=\"carousel-controls\">\n                <a data-app-prevent-settings class=\"carousel-control carousel-control-prev\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mbri-left mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"sr-only\">Previous</span>\n                </a>\n                <a data-app-prevent-settings class=\"carousel-control carousel-control-next\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mbri-right mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"sr-only\">Next</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
