          "_name": "content3",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features1\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n      <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n      <header>Size</header>\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n      <header>Additional</header>\n\n      <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n          <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n          <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n          <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n          <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n      </select>\n      <header>Background</header>\n      <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/grey-clothing-material-822x800.jpg\" parallax selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#1f2732\">\n        <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n      </fieldset>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#000000\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n      <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n      <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n              <div class=\"card-box\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white mbr-bold\"></a><h4 class=\"card-title align-center  mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b><br></b><b>TEAM AFRO <br>AWARDS (AFRICA)</b></h4></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white mbr-bold\"></a><h4 class=\"card-title align-center  mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\">&nbsp;- The dedicated team behind the Afro Awards USA comprises the African- Home Team leader Mr.&nbsp;<b>Cyril Robinson (Country Director)</b>, &nbsp;Mss. <b>Stella Izuwa </b>(Country Coordinator), and a group of diligent coordinating members with a range of activities in Africa and Nigeria.  At the helm of affairs of the organization is Mr. Taiwo Oduala, a distinguished multiple award winner, who proudly serves as the President and Chairman of the globally recognized <b>ODUATAJ FOUNDATION.</b>  We are united in our mission tasks to honor and celebrate the excellence, culture, and achievements of <br>American Africans and Africans on an international stage.</h4></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n              <div class=\"card-box\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white mbr-bold\"></a><h4 class=\"card-title align-center  mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white mbr-bold\">TUTUTECH GLOBAL<br><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Africa:+234 (803)-344-6000</span></a></h4></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 3\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n              <div class=\"card-box\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white mbr-bold\"></a><h4 class=\"card-title align-center  mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"></h4>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</section>",
