            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"clients\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"BootstrapCarouselSwipe,mbr-clients-slider\" data-interval=\"false\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Items\" name=\"slidesCount\" min=\"1\" max=\"20\" step=\"1\" value=\"17\">\n        <select title=\"Visible Slides\" name=\"visibleSlides\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\" selected>6</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"showAutoplay\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Autoplay Interval (ms)\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1000\" max=\"8000\" step=\"1000\" value=\"2000\" condition=\"showAutoplay\">\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uNCr7NdOJgw\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Gradient Background\" name=\"gradientBg\" checked condition=\"bg.type=='color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#0b1233\" condition=\"gradientBg &&bg.type=='color'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>  \n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n        <div class=\"container mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle||showSubtitle\">\n            <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 align-center\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">:: <b>AWARD SUPPORTERS AND PARTICIPANTS ADVERTS AT THE HUMANITARIAN AND EXCELLENCE AWARDS - AFRO AWARDS 2.0</b>&nbsp;::&nbsp;</h2>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\"><i>...for a minimum rate, your business Brand Logo will gain public link back to your official website on click on your brand identity. It is&nbsp;</i><br><i>designed to promote and advertise your brand and services.&nbsp;</i><i>Make use of our <b>#LogoAdvertSpace </b>advantage. We love your visit and </i><br><i>would appreciate your patronage and sponsorship engagement to touch and encourage those who cares about humanity and </i><br><i>the very needy of global existence, from America to the rest of the continents of Africa, we have synegestically come together to realise </i><br><i>the power in celebrating an effort of great people keeping the world safe. Those who supports making the world a better habitat, <br>Touching lives in so many ways we have not noticed shall be unveiled &nbsp;- a celebration of &nbsp;<b>\"Humanitarian and Excellence\"</b>.</i></h3>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"carousel slide\" role=\"listbox\" data-pause=\"true\" data-keyboard=\"false\" data-ride=\"{{showAutoplay ? 'carousel' : 'false'}}\" data-interval=\"{{showAutoplay ? interval : 'false'}}\">\n            <div class=\"carousel-inner\" mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"slidesCount\" data-visible=\"{{visibleSlides}}\">\n                <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://hadifafrica.org\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/hadif-1.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"HADIF\" title=\"HADIF FOUNDATION\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://afroftema.org\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/afroftema-1.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"AFROFTEMA AWARDS\" title=\"AFROFTEMA AWARDS\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://cyrilrobinson.com\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-17.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"CYRILROBINSON.COM WEB MEDIA\" title=\"WEB MEDIA & CREATIVE COMPANY\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://tututechllc.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/512-x-513.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"#TUTUTECHLLC\" title=\"#TUTUTECHLLC\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n            <div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"https://flowrhythm.studio/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/flowrythm-1.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"FLOW RHYTHM - It's a Win - Win situation\" title=\"FLOW RHYTHM - It's a Win - Win situation\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://www.oduatajfoundation.com\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/oduataj-foundation.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"http://www.oduatajfoundation.com\" title=\"ODUATAJ FOUNDATION\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-9.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"Advertisement\" title=\"Advertisement\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-14.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"Advertisement\" title=\"Advertisement\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://nanornhub.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-30.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"Nanorn Hub Limited\" title=\"EEF\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/zafaa-1.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"ZAFAA\" title=\"EEF\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"https://tututechllc.com\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/512-x-513.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"#TUTUTECHLLC\" title=\"#TUTUTECHLLC\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/oduataj-foundation.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"Oduataj Foundation\" title=\"EEF\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-9.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"Advertisement\" title=\"Advertisement\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"http://CyrilRobinson.com\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-17.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"CYRIL ROBINSON'S MULTIMEDIA COMPANY\" title=\"CYRIL ROBINSON'S NANORN HUB LIMITED\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"https://www.flowrhythm.studio/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/flowrythm-1.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"FlowRhythm Studio\" title=\"ZAFAA GLOBAL AWARDS\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"https://www.dga.org\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/dga-1.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"directors guild of america - DGA\" title=\"directors guild of america - DGA\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div><div class=\"carousel-item \">\n                    <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"wrap-img \">\n                                <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-14.png\" class=\"img-responsive clients-img\" alt=\"ADVERT SPACE - OPEN AD SPACE. CALL NOW\" title=\"ADVERT SPACE - OPEN AD SPACE. CALL NOW\"></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div></div>\n            <div class=\"carousel-controls\">\n                <a data-app-prevent-settings class=\"carousel-control carousel-control-prev\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mbri-left mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"sr-only\">Previous</span>\n                </a>\n                <a data-app-prevent-settings class=\"carousel-control carousel-control-next\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mbri-right mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"sr-only\">Next</span>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "u9a5oS6wYQ",
          "_anchor": "clients-9h",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".logo__image": {
              "width": "(@widthLogo * 1px)",
              "object-fit": "cover"
            },
            ".footer__content": {
              "margin-bottom": "30px",
              "&:last-child": {
                "margin-bottom": "0"
              }
            },
            ".title__address": {
              "margin-bottom": "20px",
              "color": "#e7c805"
            },
            ".privacy": {
              "margin-bottom": "10px",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "text-align": "left"
              },
              "color": "#a69952",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".divider": {
              "background-color": "@dividerColor",
              "opacity": ".1",
              "margin": "90px 0 25px",
              "height": "1px"
            },
            ".form-group": {
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "padding-right": "0"
            },
            ".form-control": {
              "height": "50px",
              "border": "none",
              "padding": "14px 18px",
              "background-color": "@formBgColor !important",
              "font-size": "16px",
              "color": "@colorForm",
              "& when (@transparent)": {
                "background-color": "transparent !important",
                "border-radius": "4px",
                "border": "1px solid @borderColor"
              }
            },
            ".input-group-btn": {
              "padding-left": "0",
              ".btn": {
                "height": "50px",
                "font-weight": "600",
                "padding": "14px 18px"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-form .input-group-btn .btn": {
              "border-radius": "4px !important"
            },
            ".mbr-form .btn": {
              "margin": "0"
            },
            "input::-webkit-input-placeholder": {
              "color": "@colorForm",
              "opacity": ".8"
            },
            "input::-moz-placeholder": {
              "color": "@colorForm",
              "opacity": ".8"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".wrap": {
                "padding-bottom": "25px"
              },
              ".divider": {
                "margin": "0 0 20px"
              }
            },
            ".work__address": {
              "color": "#89c0de"
            },
            "LABEL": {
              "color": "#eeefaf"
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer1",
          "_sourceTheme": "conferencem4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"footer1\" group=\"Footer\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-reveal': reveal, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" always-bottom global plugins=\"formstyler, datepicker\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reveal effect\" name=\"reveal\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Brand\" name=\"showBrand\" checked>\n        <select name=\"typeMenu\" title=\"Type Menu\" condition=\"showBrand\">\n            <option value=\"1\">Logo Text</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>Logo Image</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Width Logo\" name=\"widthLogo\" min=\"20\" max=\"100\" step=\"2\" value=\"100\" condition=\"showBrand && typeMenu == 2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Hide Column\" name=\"hideColumn\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Bottom\" name=\"showPrivacy\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Divider Color\" value=\"#fff93f\" name=\"dividerColor\" condition=\"showPrivacy\">\n        <header>Form</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Text Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"colorForm\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent Form\" name=\"transparent\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Form Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"formBgColor\" condition=\"!transparent\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#ffdc00\" name=\"borderColor\" condition=\"transparent\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bgreservation-1-1879x694.jpg\" selected parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#000000\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"usedRecaptcha\" value=\"false\"></mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'justify-content-between' : !showBrand || !hideColumn}\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 wrap order-0\" mbr-if=\"showBrand\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3' : !hideColumn, 'col-lg-2' : hideColumn}\">\n               <p class=\"brand__text mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"typeMenu == 1\" data-app-selector=\".brand__text\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-warning mbr-bold\">Conference</a></p>\n                 <img class=\"logo__image\" mbr-if=\"typeMenu == 2\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/afroawards-1.png\" alt=\"Afro Awards\" title=\"Afro Awards - Powered by: Oduataj Productions And Entertainment Inc.\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 wrap\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3' : showBrand, 'col-lg-4' : !showBrand}\" mbr-if=\"hideColumn\">\n                <div class=\"footer__content\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-semibold title__address\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".title__address\">Los Angeles:</h4>\n                    <p class=\"work__address mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".work__address\"><b>One of the biggest events in 2026 taking place in LA to be announced, get ready and be there!</b></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"footer__content\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-semibold title__address\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".title__address\">California:</h4>\n                    <p class=\"work__address mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".work__address\">Know that it is a quality Event and for the fact it is an Award, we're expecting everybody.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 wrap\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3' : showBrand, 'col-lg-4' : !showBrand, 'col-lg-6' : !showBrand && !hideColumn}\">\n                <div class=\"footer__content\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-semibold title__address\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".title__address\">Partnership:</h4>\n                    <p class=\"work__address mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".work__address\"><b>Your kind participation for this excellence Award is highly encouraged by everyone who finds it fit to give us Support!</b></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"footer__content\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-semibold title__address\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".title__address\">Telephone:</h4>\n                    <p class=\"work__address mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".work__address\">(+1)&nbsp;<b>720-650-9998<br></b>We will continue to provide updates on the activities of the Afro Awards 5.0.<b><br></b></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 wrap\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-6' : !showBrand && !hideColumn, 'col-lg-4' : showBrand || hideColumn}\">\n                <div class=\"footer__content\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-semibold title__address\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".title__address\">Subscribe:<br></h4>\n                   <div mbr-form class=\"subscribe__form\">\n<!--Formbuilder Form-->\n<form action=\"info@afroawards.org\" name=\"Afro Awards Subscription\" method=\"POST\" data-rcpha_sitekey=\"6Lf-cYUnAAAAAGP4IQS8d9cBWOT8V2hEbXGegElz\" data-rcpha_secretkey=\"6Lf-cYUnAAAAAFiIdsxEJFOeOcPxIE9Z5mOV2_Kl\" class=\"mbr-form form-with-styler\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div hidden=\"hidden\" data-form-alert class=\"alert alert-success col-12\">Thanks for AFRO AWARDS SUBSCRIPTION</div>\n<div hidden=\"hidden\" data-form-alert-danger class=\"alert alert-danger col-12\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dragArea row\">\n<div class=\"col form-group\" data-for=\"email\">\n<input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"email required\" data-form-field=\"email\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" required=\"required\" class=\"form-control\" value>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col input-group-btn\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrLink,-mbrBtnRemove,-mbrBtnAdd\"><a type=\"submit\" class=\"w-100 w-100 w-100 w-100 w-100 w-100 w-100 btn btn-lg btn-info\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Subscribe</a></div>\n</div>\n</form><!--Formbuilder Form-->\n</div>\n                </div>\n            </div> \n            \n            \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"divider\" mbr-if=\"showPrivacy\"></div>\n            <div class=\"row align-items-baseline\" mbr-if=\"showPrivacy\">\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                     <p class=\"privacy mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".privacy\"><b>AFRO AWARDS 5.0<br>&nbsp;</b><b><i>Bridging Continents, Fostering Innovation, and <br>Promoting Sustainable Development\"</i></b><br><i><br></i><i>Designed and TechMedia Development Control:&nbsp;<br></i><b>CYRIL ROBINSON</b><i> (<b>AA</b> Country Director)</i><br><b>Co-founder and COO TUTUTECH LLC, Charlotte, NC., USA.&nbsp;</b><br><br><i><b>Technology IT management Expert:</b><br><b>TUTUTECH</b></i><b>™</b><i><b>&nbsp;LLC. Charlotte, North Carolina, USA</b></i><b><br></b><a href=\"http://tututechllc.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-danger\"><b><i>Website</i></b> </a><b><i>|</i></b>&nbsp;<a href=\"contact.html#contact2-54\" class=\"text-danger text-primary\" style><b><i>Email</i></b></a>&nbsp;<b>:&nbsp;</b><br><b><i>support@tututechllc.com</i></b><br><b><i>Tel: &nbsp;+1 (704)-737-2178 , +1 (704)-685-5556</i></b><br></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                     <p class=\"privacy mbr-fonts-style align-right\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".privacy\"><b>AFRO AWARDS 2025, USA</b> \n<br><i><b>A n n o u n c e s</b></i>&nbsp;<br><b>AFRO AWARDS 5.0 - 2026 || 4th Annual\n</b><br><b>Los Angeles...&nbsp;</b><br>@ The prestigious :\n<br><b>DGA- DIRECTORS GUILD OF AMERICA</b>\n<br><b>7920 Sunset Blvd, Los Angeles, CA 90046, United States.</b><br><br><b>Supported by:\n</b><br><b>ODUATAJ FOUNDATION UNITED STATES</b><br>© 2024 AfroAwards.org - All Rights Reserved.  #1stAfroAwards\n<br><b>Powered by: ODUATAJ PRODUCTIONS &amp; ENTERTAINMENT INC</b><br><a href=\"https://afroawards.org/photos/administrator\" class=\"text-success\" target=\"_blank\"><b><i>Administer to Social Photos by Open Source Social Network</i></b></a><br><br><a href=\"https://afroawards.org/photos/administrator\" class=\"text-primary\" target=\"_blank\"><br></a></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                \n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_isUserblock": true,
