          "_name": "accordion",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"accordion\" group=\"Accordion\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mbr-switch-arrow, font-awesome\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Left/Right Content\" name=\"reverse\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Accordion</header>\n        <select title=\"Accordions Count\" name=\"bootstrapAccordion\">\n             <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n             <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n             <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n             <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n             <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n             <option value=\"6\" selected>6</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/whatsapp-image-2022-11-09-at-6.47.40-pm-4.jpeg\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#97a8cb\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#000206\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverse}\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-semibold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">Honorees</h3>\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">Questions - Answers <br><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">(FAQ for the Afro Award)</span></h2>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\"The list of nominees for this prestigious award comprises great individuals who <br>have been carefully chosen and endorsed <br>for thorough scrutiny, both privately and publicly, including an examination of their historical contributions. This scrutiny delves deeper into their humanitarian efforts, financial support, and social commitments aimed at transforming lives and fostering human capital development. These individuals are champions of change, influencing the mechanisms that sustain our world.\n<br>\n<br>Their impact extends far beyond merely holding power; it is a testament to their unwavering dedication to ensuring smiles on the faces of humanity.\n<br>\n<br>It is, indeed, imperative that we honor and celebrate those who wholeheartedly dedicate themselves to improving the quality of life for all.\"</p>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-buttons data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-success-outline\" href=\"pressrelease2023.html#extTestimonials5-57\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Read More</a></div>\n                </div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-1 d-none d-lg-block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-7 col-md-8\">\n                <div id=\"bootstrap-accordion\" class=\"panel-group accordionStyles accordion\" role=\"tablist\" aria-multiselectable=\"true\">\n                    <div class=\"card\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingOne\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"panel-title collapsed text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse1\">\n                                <h4 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>&nbsp;What is aims and objectives of Afro Awards?</h4>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse1\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse \" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingOne\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\"><br>The answer for the above question is being updated soon, our content developer updates the platform on timely basis. We promised to keep you updated and assuring all nominees are truly worth being celebrated in this event.<br><br>This is a bodycopy of contents to be composed for every question asked. Because you asked!, We shall adequately and satisfactrily respond to all your questions.<br><br>Thank you for the benefit and we shall continue to put in our whole best, ensure the best that you can be proud of.<br><br><b>If you care to talk to our representatives, kindly call: +17206509998</b><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 1\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingTwo\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse2\">\n                                <h4 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>&nbsp;What is the Mission for establishing the Award?</h4>\n                            </a>\n                            \n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse2\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingTwo\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\"><br>The answer for the above question is being updated soon, our content developer updates the platform on timely basis. We promised to keep you updated and assuring all nominees are truly worth being celebrated in this event.\n<br>\n<br>This is a bodycopy of contents to be composed for every question asked. Because you asked!, We shall adequately and satisfactrily respond to all your questions.\n<br>\n<br>Thank you for the benefit and we shall continue to put in our whole best, ensure the best that you can be proud of.<br><br><b>If you care to talk to our representatives, kindly call: +17206509998</b><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 2\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingThree\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed text-black panel-title\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse3\">\n                                <h4 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span>&nbsp;What exactly was the reason for Afro Awards?</h4>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse3\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingThree\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\">The answer for the above question is being updated soon, our content developer updates the platform on timely basis. We promised to keep you updated and assuring all nominees are truly worth being celebrated in this event.\n<br>\n<br>This is a bodycopy of contents to be composed for every question asked. Because you asked!, We shall adequately and satisfactrily respond to all your questions.\n<br>\n<br>Thank you for the benefit and we shall continue to put in our whole best, ensure the best that you can be proud of.<br><br><b>If you care to talk to our representatives, kindly call: +17206509998</b><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 3\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFour\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse4\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse4\">\n                                <h4 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span> Why the Choice of Los Angeles?</h4>\n                            </a> \n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse4\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFour\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\"><br>The answer for the above question is being updated soon, our content developer updates the platform on timely basis. We promised to keep you updated and assuring all nominees are truly worth being celebrated in this event.\n<br>\n<br>This is a bodycopy of contents to be composed for every question asked. Because you asked!, We shall adequately and satisfactrily respond to all your questions.\n<br>\n<br>Thank you for the benefit and we shall continue to put in our whole best, ensure the best that you can be proud of.<br><br><b>If you care to talk to our representatives, kindly call: +17206509998</b><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 4\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingFive\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse5\">\n                                <h4 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span> Why was the Award attracted much interest?</h4>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse5\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingFive\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\"><br>The answer for the above question is being updated soon, our content developer updates the platform on timely basis. We promised to keep you updated and assuring all nominees are truly worth being celebrated in this event.\n<br>\n<br>This is a bodycopy of contents to be composed for every question asked. Because you asked!, We shall adequately and satisfactrily respond to all your questions.\n<br>\n<br>Thank you for the benefit and we shall continue to put in our whole best, ensure the best that you can be proud of.<br><br><b>If you care to talk to our representatives, kindly call: +17206509998</b><br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapAccordion > 5\">\n                        <div class=\"card-header\" role=\"tab\" id=\"headingSix\">\n                            <a role=\"button\" class=\"collapsed panel-title text-black\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-core href=\"#collapse6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapse6\">\n                                <h4 class=\" mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                    <span class=\"sign mbr-iconfont mbri-arrow-down inactive\"></span> What was the major attraction of Afro Awards?</h4>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div id=\"collapse6\" class=\"panel-collapse noScroll collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"headingSix\" data-parent=\"#accordion\">\n                            <div class=\"panel-body\">\n                                <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style panel-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".panel-text\"><br>The answer for the above question is being updated soon, our content developer updates the platform on timely basis. We promised to keep you updated and assuring all nominees are truly worth being celebrated in this event.\n<br>\n<br>This is a bodycopy of contents to be composed for every question asked. Because you asked!, We shall adequately and satisfactrily respond to all your questions.\n<br>\n<br>Thank you for the benefit and we shall continue to put in our whole best, ensure the best that you can be proud of.<br><br><b>If you care to talk to our representatives, kindly call:&nbsp;+17206509998</b></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
