          "_name": "features10",
          "_sourceTheme": "appm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features10\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Label\" name=\"showLabel\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"TextColor\" title=\"Text Background\" value=\"#160837\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image\" name=\"showImg\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"ImgColor\" title=\"Image Background\" value=\"#041629\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/next-event-2.jpg\" selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b4d3a6\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#001235\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 text-col\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"icon-box\">\n                        <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-quote-left mobi-mbri\" style=\"font-size: 48px; color: rgb(7, 145, 201); fill: rgb(7, 145, 201);\"></span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Mazi Cyril Robinson</b> is the Country Director for Afro Awards Nigeria, playing a key role in coordinating the event's African operations.\n<div><b>Mazi Cyril Robinson</b> is a prominent figure within the Afro Awards organization, which celebrates African excellence and cultural achievements on a global stage. Here's a deeper look at his role and affiliations.<br><br></div><div>🌍 <b>Role in Afro Awards\n</b></div><div><b>-</b> <b>Country Director</b>, Afro Awards Nigeria: Cyril Robinson is officially listed as the Country Director for Nigeria on the Afro Awards website.\n<br><br></div><div><b>- Team Africa Member: </b><br>He is part of the African-based \"Home Team\" that handles essential administrative tasks and coordinates activities across Nigeria and Africa for the Afro Awards USA.\n<br><br></div><div><b>- Collaborates with Leadership: </b><br>He works alongside Stella Izuwa (Country Coordinator) and under the leadership of Mr. Taiwo Oduala, the Founder and Chairman of Afro Awards and the ODUATAJ Foundation.\n<br><br></div><div>🎖 <b>MISSION AND IMPACT</b></div><div><b>- Promoting African Excellence: <br></b>The Afro Awards aim to honor individuals and organizations that contribute to Africa’s cultural, social, and economic development.\n<br><br></div><div><b>- Global Recognition: <br></b>Through his role, Robinson helps bridge the gap between African achievements and international recognition, ensuring that Nigerian contributions are well represented.</div></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style name-text mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".name-text\"><b>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Mazi (Ambassador) Cyril Robinson</b><b>&nbsp;(Nigeria)</b></p>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style prof-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".prof-text\">\n                        Co-founder and founding pioneers<br><b>IKWUANO AMBASSADORS NIGERIA</b></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6 img-col\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImg\">\n                    <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/cyril-robinson-001-mazi.jpg\" alt=\"Mazi Cyril Robinson\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
