          "_name": "extFeatures28",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"extFeatures\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"> \n        \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Section Buttons\" name=\"showSectionButtons\" checked>\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Сards Title\" name=\"showContentTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse Content\" name=\"reverseContent\" condition=\"cardsAmount !== '1'\" checked>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background4-3.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#c3c3c3\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://youtu.be/iM-NestDPNQ\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#efefef\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay&&bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6':cardsAmount<3,\n                             'col-md-4':cardsAmount>2,\n                             'order-md-2': reverseContent&amp;&amp;cardsAmount>1}\">\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Taiwo Oduala set to launch AFRO AWARDS 2023</h2>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-text section-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".section-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\"><a href=\"https://punchng.com/movie-director-oduala-to-launch-maiden-afro-awards-in-los-angeles/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>https://punchng.com/movie-director-oduala-to-launch-maiden-afro-awards-in-los-angeles/</b></a></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\"></span></div><div><br></div><div>“AFRO AWARDS 2022 is one that will bring together big names in the global industries across the globe, and it would be the best place to get to meet with other personalities, and possibly have interactions that would change the course of lives.&nbsp;\n</div><div>\n</div><div><b><a href=\"https://www.sunnewsonline.com/taiwo-oduala-set-to-launch-afro-awards-2022/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-info\">https://www.sunnewsonline.com/taiwo-oduala-set-to-launch-afro-awards-2022/</a></b> &nbsp;\n<br><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\">Taiwo Oduala set to launch AFRO AWARDS 2023.<br><br><i><b>Afro Awards 2022: Osun Governor-Elect, Ademola, Davido, Others Bag Awards in California</b>.</i></span></div><br><div><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\">Also, to be honoured is the First Lady of Sierra Leone, Mrs Fatima Maada and Ayuko Babu (Founder &amp; CEO of the Pan African Film Festival and Seye Kehinde, a renowned Nigerian Journalist.</span></div><div>\n</div><div><br></div></h3>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSectionButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-md mx-3 btn-info\" href=\"https://www.africanleadershipmagazine.co.uk/afro-awards-2022-osun-governor-elect-ademola-davido-others-bag-awards-in-california/\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">leadership</a> <a class=\"btn btn-md mx-3 btn-secondary-outline\" href=\"https://www.africanleadershipmagazine.co.uk/afro-awards-2022-osun-governor-elect-ademola-davido-others-bag-awards-in-california/\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Vanguard</a> <a class=\"btn btn-md mx-3 btn-info-outline\" href=\"https://nnn.ng/osun-governor-elect-davido-others-bag-afro-awards-2022/\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">NNN Online</a> <a class=\"btn btn-md mx-3 btn-black\" href=\"https://naija247news.com/2022/11/03/osun-governor-elect-davido-others-bag-afro-awards-2022/\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Naija 247</a></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6':cardsAmount<3,\n                             'col-md-4':cardsAmount>2}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-img\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/chyke-standing-photoroom.png\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                    <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>Fred Chyke — A 2023 Global Talent Unleashed w</b><b style=\"font-size: 1.5625rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; background-color: transparent;\">ith <br>his groundbreaking performance “Censorship,”&nbsp;</b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text card-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text,.mbr-section-btn\"><b>&nbsp;Fred Chyke</b> swept the field to secure the Global VISA Talent title with a wide margin. Representing Nigeria, he’s poised to take the world by storm — an <b>AfroFusion </b>force ready to redefine global music and culture.<br>&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn-underline mr-3\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">&nbsp; Read More</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6':cardsAmount<3,\n                             'col-md-4':cardsAmount>2}\">\n                <div class=\"card-img\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/company-name.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                    <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>ODUATAJ ENTERTAINMENT INC. U.S.A</b><br><br><b>Foremost Movie Director, Taiwo Oduala, CEO Oduataj productions and Entertainment Inc. is set to launch AFRO AWARDS 2023 in Los Angeles.</b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text card-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text,.mbr-section-btn\"><br><b>“VANGUARD NEWS:</b><br><a href=\"https://www.vanguardngr.com/2022/05/taiwo-oduala-set-to-launch-afro-awards-2022/\" target=\"_blank\"><b>https://www.vanguardngr.com/2022/05/taiwo-oduala-set-to-launch-afro-awards-2022/.\n</b></a><br><br><b>Taiwo Oduala </b>said that the awaradees as are among Africans and Americans, who distinguished themselves in various fields of endeavours...<br><br><b><i><b><i><a href=\"https://www.sunnewsonline.com/nigerian-american-film-director-to-honor-africans-and-americans-at-afro-awards-2022/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-info\">Nigerian American Film Director to Honor Africans and Americans at the 2nd Afro Awards&nbsp;</a>2023</i></b><a href=\"https://www.vanguardngr.com/2022/05/taiwo-oduala-set-to-launch-afro-awards-2022/\" target=\"_blank\"><br></a></i></b><br> \n<br><br> \n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn-underline mr-3\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Read More</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_cid": "uRhdtI6IdG",
          "_anchor": "extFeatures28-aa",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
