          "_name": "content1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"header3 vertical-line\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"15\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle 2\" name=\"showSubTitle2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Line\" name=\"showLine\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bg2-trouphy.jpg\" selected parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f3f3f3\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Gradient\" name=\"gradientBg\" condition=\"bg.type == 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#f5c40d\" condition=\"gradientBg && bg.type == 'color'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#7de3ff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-5\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-figure\">\n                    <a href=\"#\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/trouphy-page-new-2.png\" alt=\"Taiwo Oduala\" title=\"Afro Awards - Taiwo Oduala\"></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-7 left-block\">\n                <div class=\"media-content\">\n                  <div class=\"line line-title\" mbr-if=\"showLine\" data-app-selector=\".media-content, .line\"></div>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title  align-left mbr-bold mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".media-content, .mbr-section-title, .line-title\"><p>THIS IS AFRO AWARDS 4.0&nbsp; <br>2025 Edition&nbsp; in Los Angeles. CA, U.S.A</p><p>@ The prestigious :\n</p><p>DGA- DIRECTORS GUILD OF AMERICA\n</p><p>VENUE:<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> 7920 Sunset Blvd, Los Angeles, CA 90046, USA.</span></p></h2>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-section-subtitle-1 mbr-bold align-left mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle-1\">CREDIBLE AND VERSATILITY APPLICATION DESIGNER. BUILDS AWARDS PLATFORM.</h3>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-text\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text align-left mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Hollywood Movie Director,<b> Taiwo Oduala</b>, CEO <b>Oduataj Productions and Entertainment Inc.</b><br><br>🔥 THIS IS AFRO AWARDS 4.0 — 2025 Edition\n<br>The legacy continues. The Afro Awards 2025 builds on a powerful foundation of cultural pride, artistic impact, and humanitarian excellence. With each edition, the celebration grows louder, more vibrant, and deeply meaningful — shining a global spotlight on individuals whose talents and efforts uplift humanity.\n<br>✨ In this year’s chapter:\n<br>- We amplify voices that challenge boundaries and redefine success\n<br>- We celebrate diversity as a strength and a shared story\n<br>- We honor changemakers, creatives, and visionaries across all disciplines\n<br>🌍 Following the global resonance of Afro Awards 3.0, this fourth installment promises to be even more dynamic. From soulful performances to uplifting tributes, every moment will be crafted to inspire, elevate, and connect.\n<br>📢 Nominations remain open worldwide.\n<br>Final details will be announced soon — stay tuned, get involved, and prepare to witness greatness celebrated on an unforgettable scale.\n<br>&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-section-subtitle-2 mbr-bold align-left mbr-black mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle-2\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/cyrilrobinson/\" target=\"_blank\">FAKON EMPIRE ENTERTAINMENT AWARDS COMMENCES 2022 WITH FREE ENTRY TICKET FOR IBANLA FILM PREMIERE IS NOW OVER. THANK YOU FOR THOSE WHO WAS ABLE TO ATTEND AND IT WAS A HISTORY MADE. A VERY BIG THANK YOU TO ALL. GOD BLESS!&nbsp;</a></h3>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-left\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a class=\"btn mbr-bold text-black btn-danger\" href=\"page3.html#content1-w\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Continue</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
