          "_name": "extFeatures28",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"extFeatures\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"> \n        \n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Section Buttons\" name=\"showSectionButtons\" checked>\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Сards Title\" name=\"showContentTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\" selected>1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse Content\" name=\"reverseContent\" condition=\"cardsAmount !== '1'\" checked>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/cn3a1074.jpg\" parallax selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://youtu.be/iM-NestDPNQ\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#0e1721\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay&&bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6':cardsAmount<3,\n                             'col-md-4':cardsAmount>2,\n                             'order-md-2': reverseContent&amp;&amp;cardsAmount>1}\">\n                <h2 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><div>Empowerment and Support by Afro Awards and its <b>Oduataj Foundation</b> to communities, Less privileged, Youth Substance and drug free outreach in America and globally.<br><br><b>PLEASE DONATE TO SUPPORT THIS CAUSE,</b> Thank you.\n<br><br></div><div>Donation link in Bio,</div></h2>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-text section-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".section-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\"><a href=\"https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/donation-form/afro-awards\" class=\"text-success\" target=\"_blank\"><b>https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/donation-form/afro-awards</b></a></span><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>DONATIONS:&nbsp;</b></div><div><b><i>To AFRO AWARDS/<span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\">ODUATAJ FOUNDATION (501(c)(3) Nonprofit.</span></i></b></div><div><br></div><div><b>ZELLE :-</b></div><div><b>oduatajking@gmail.com</b></div><div><br></div><div><b>Cashapp</b> : <b>7205925589</b>.</div><div><br></div><div><b>BANK OF AMERICA (BOA)</b></div><div><b>&nbsp;Account No:&nbsp;</b></div><div><b>325180555969&nbsp;</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>&nbsp;Routine Number:</b></div><div><b>121000358&nbsp;</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Wires: <br>026009593</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Thank you to everyone who participated and contributed in the success of this year’s show.&nbsp;</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>Our mission is to continue to build, grow, uplift, support and honor our community.&nbsp;</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>If you’re interested in being a Sponsor or Brand Partner in next year’s show please inbox us your contact information asap.</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>If you would like to make a charitable donation to assist our mission of growth and uplifting our community, click the DONATION button below please.&nbsp;</b></div><div><br></div><div><b>ANY contribution would greatly be appreciated 🙏🏽<br><br>Thanks! 🥰</b></div><div><br></div><div><b>#donations #donationswelcome #donationdrive #donationsappreciated #global #fyp #fypシ #love #fun #funny #oduatajfoundation #oduatajentertaiment</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\"><br><b>Sponsorship Packages unveiling soon.</b></span></div><div>\n</div><div><br></div></h3>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-2\" mbr-if=\"showSectionButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-md mx-3 btn-info\" href=\"https://www.zeffy.com/en-US/donation-form/afro-awards\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">DONATE NOW!</a></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6':cardsAmount<3,\n                             'col-md-4':cardsAmount>2}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-img\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/socialmedia.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                    <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>Social Media Links and Follow Up:</b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text card-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text,.mbr-section-btn\">AFRO AWARDS \n<br>2023. &nbsp;Los Angeles, California. USA<br><br><b>Taiwo Oduala set to launch AFRO AWARDS 2023<br></b><br>&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn-underline mr-3\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">&nbsp; Read More</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col-12\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6':cardsAmount<3,\n                             'col-md-4':cardsAmount>2}\">\n                <div class=\"card-img\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/logo-oduataj.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\" title>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-box\">\n                    <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showContentTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>ODUATAJ ENTERTAINMENT INC. U.S.A</b><br><br><b>Foremost Movie Director, Taiwo Oduala, CEO Oduataj productions and Entertainment Inc. is set to launch AFRO AWARDS 2023 in Los Angeles.</b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text card-text mbr-fonts-style mbr-light\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text,.mbr-section-btn\"><br><b>Sponsorship Packages unveiling soon.</b><br> \n<br><br> \n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn-underline mr-3\" href=\"https://mobirise.com\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">&nbsp; &nbsp;Read More</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
